# purpose: M1 with accounts interleaved more aggressively than medium-1, and
#          rejections positioned right before and after accepted commands.
# exercises: OPEN/DEPOSIT/BALANCE only; unknown-account and account-exists; seq continuity.
DEPOSIT k1 1
OPEN k1 USD
DEPOSIT k1 1
OPEN k2 USD
OPEN k1 EUR
DEPOSIT k2 2
DEPOSIT k3 3
OPEN k3 GBP
DEPOSIT k3 3
DEPOSIT k1 0.99
DEPOSIT k2 0.01
BALANCE k1
BALANCE k2
BALANCE k3
BALANCE k4
OPEN k4 EUR
BALANCE k4
DEPOSIT k4 1000000
DEPOSIT k4 0.01
DEPOSIT k1 98.01
BALANCE k1
BALANCE k4
OPEN k4 EUR
OPEN k2 EUR
DEPOSIT k2 7.98
BALANCE k2
